        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_21b38053899e4dcd97f019f6290ab97d",
      "statement": "In daemon mode force is always set (overwriting without prompting) and renewer.Daemon loops on signals: SIGHUP forces immediate renewal, SIGINT/SIGTERM exit cleanly, and a timer triggers scheduled renewals; failures retry after 1 minute (durationOnErrors).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/renew.go#L329-L334",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f3e477e699645720759acff6b518f9c17ac5fedd6c1e0275b01fedf2206c99d3:"
        },
        {
