      "id": "claim_0518edfa592347969dfe4bb509ab481e",
      "statement": "The default renewal threshold is 66% of the lifetime elapsed; --expires-in accepts a percent (validated 0-100) or a Go duration compared against remaining validity; --bundle checks every certificate in the chain instead of only the leaf; input may be a file or remote URL.",
